1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:03,466
Four Mexican soldiers died to capture him.

2
00:00:03,486 --> 00:00:05,069
When it was over,

3
00:00:05,089 --> 00:00:08,677
the FBI crossed another name off its Ten Most

4
00:00:08,697 --> 00:00:09,479
Wanted list.

5
00:00:11,599 --> 00:00:13,747
For more than a decade,

6
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:15,482
Fausto Isidro Meza Flores,

7
00:00:15,502 --> 00:00:17,651
known as El Chapo Isidro,

8
00:00:17,671 --> 00:00:20,686
